{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_46cdf845cb15ed25573e62229f3861127c7e235e94501c86bef3a11792babc2a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Interactive sessions support slash commands such as /models, /byok, /websearch, and /skills subcommands (list, link, enable, disable, reload)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9c07edf6b8f8ff4d1190fe96579f0b71919b6fbdc401b131f35fcf1fa29410ba"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agent Skills follow a lifecycle of discovery (metadata injected into the system prompt), activation via an activate_skill tool, user consent, injection of SKILL.md content, and execution; skills are discovered from built-in, extension, user (~/.openagent/skills/), and workspace (.openagent/skills/) tiers with precedence rules."}],"claim_ids":["clm_46cdf845cb15ed25573e62229f3861127c7e235e94501c86bef3a11792babc2a","clm_9c07edf6b8f8ff4d1190fe96579f0b71919b6fbdc401b131f35fcf1fa29410ba"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_85422e7caab040e4b58bfd0de5ac14ec","id":"pg_5c925437fb4c5191a095be43d7fb8a87","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/haseeb-heaven-open-agent-docs-cli-skills-md-575401684ec1-be43d7fb8a87.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_868c7739945e55059e3ee33a3892d0b9"],"title":"haseeb-heaven/open-agent/docs/cli/skills.md @ 575401684ec1","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_85422e7caab040e4b58bfd0de5ac14ec"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1c1f6a71d7299884be3e3e3131414a10ed170939206e5b50e4184e154d56d023"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Cloud providers are configured via per-provider environment variables (e.g. OPENAI_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, GEMINI_API_KEY, GROQ_API_KEY, OPENROUTER_API_KEY), while local Ollama and LM Studio need no key."},{"claim_ids":["clm_22f4fa86ee392f64e6390e9420e18aff548b990b1a3813c3c5a990273a2732c6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI exposes flags including --provider, -m/--model, --free, --models, --byok, and -y/--yolo for auto-approving tools in trusted workspaces."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2a90ca5fcfb6bc246d49970c362b7f29a134f6fb8053b4a0b3adde4c1c7dd425"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project is a fork of Google's Gemini CLI (Apache-2.0) with modifications by Haseeb Mir, and is itself licensed Apache-2.0."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3309447abf730f003b0a346f99dc0a4c49d6b284260cf4854c6cddc799fefce2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A web search tool (google_web_search) auto-selects a backend from available keys, with a no-key fallback chain of Exa (hosted MCP) then DuckDuckGo, and supports Brave, Tavily, and Serper, forcible via WEB_SEARCH_PROVIDER."},{"claim_ids":["clm_46cdf845cb15ed25573e62229f3861127c7e235e94501c86bef3a11792babc2a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Interactive sessions support slash commands such as /models, /byok, /websearch, and /skills subcommands (list, link, enable, disable, reload)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_48e2c63efded4442153e778be4db95df3283d21b7f6db3301eeab5ba2382193b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool is positioned as local-first and BYOK: it supports free OpenRouter models, local Ollama/LM Studio, runs on Windows/Mac/Linux, and requires no account."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5441a2e6c3f6353140a6343b08ec26f6e7481d1eae09875704ed271f54863bb8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: tests run from repo root with npm test using Vitest, which auto-loads root .env (missing keys skip; live quota soft-skips); unit and live provider test commands are documented, with live tests gated by RUN_LIVE_PROVIDER_TESTS / RUN_LOCAL_PROVIDER_TESTS env vars."},{"claim_ids":["clm_72e29153a1b938bae6668649d18a9b37493835887ed2795639b83140672538e6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Model definitions live in a registry file configs/models.toml, referenced from the README alongside a full matrix in Models.MD."},{"claim_ids":["clm_bb97f98c3b39d626bef4e5d449a9f80a2a6a3dd4215b80c5e14c8d44c9523ccd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Extensions install from the Slack marketplace or Claude .claude-plugin manifests (plus open-agent-extension.json and .mcp.json formats) via --install-extension, with --auto skipping trust prompts for trusted extensions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_bc552c8bb4c9506aa2ba14f95e6498304c955b506af5d878d7978ddcb3e38fa6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project requires Node.js 22+ and is published on npm as @haseeb_heaven/open-agent, installable globally with npm install -g."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1c1f6a71d7299884be3e3e3131414a10ed170939206e5b50e4184e154d56d023","clm_22f4fa86ee392f64e6390e9420e18aff548b990b1a3813c3c5a990273a2732c6","clm_2a90ca5fcfb6bc246d49970c362b7f29a134f6fb8053b4a0b3adde4c1c7dd425","clm_3309447abf730f003b0a346f99dc0a4c49d6b284260cf4854c6cddc799fefce2","clm_46cdf845cb15ed25573e62229f3861127c7e235e94501c86bef3a11792babc2a","clm_48e2c63efded4442153e778be4db95df3283d21b7f6db3301eeab5ba2382193b","clm_5441a2e6c3f6353140a6343b08ec26f6e7481d1eae09875704ed271f54863bb8","clm_72e29153a1b938bae6668649d18a9b37493835887ed2795639b83140672538e6","clm_bb97f98c3b39d626bef4e5d449a9f80a2a6a3dd4215b80c5e14c8d44c9523ccd","clm_bc552c8bb4c9506aa2ba14f95e6498304c955b506af5d878d7978ddcb3e38fa6"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_85422e7caab040e4b58bfd0de5ac14ec","id":"pg_926eb6d2575e54f5aebc197e15295c77","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/haseeb-heaven-open-agent-readme-md-575401684ec1-197e15295c77.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_595b8e1ad29a59b598c78be8e0f00240"],"title":"haseeb-heaven/open-agent/README.md @ 575401684ec1","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_85422e7caab040e4b58bfd0de5ac14ec"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_c617d814fd8de28670bb3c0326c61e1334b9856a7562f78c2513efc14d874f14"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The agent persists durable facts and preferences by editing Markdown memory files: shared project instructions in OPENAGENT.md, private notes in a per-project folder, and personal preferences in ~/.openagent/OPENAGENT.md, loaded into future sessions' context."}],"claim_ids":["clm_c617d814fd8de28670bb3c0326c61e1334b9856a7562f78c2513efc14d874f14"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_85422e7caab040e4b58bfd0de5ac14ec","id":"pg_99eeffe7bc175e75b6eecd5f8d9c2b50","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/haseeb-heaven-open-agent-docs-tools-memory-md-575401684ec1-cd5f8d9c2b50.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_d0d49ab0794f592e8b24d10513483209"],"title":"haseeb-heaven/open-agent/docs/tools/memory.md @ 575401684ec1","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_85422e7caab040e4b58bfd0de5ac14ec"}
