{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1a267d1f9e59ecbe3f9857f319f910fd34fac681ce0ec2aa22a46761640b06f9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: canonical agent instructions for AI coding agents working in this repo live in OPENAGENT.md, referenced from GEMINI.md as applying to Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Codex, opencode, and OpenAgent itself."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1a267d1f9e59ecbe3f9857f319f910fd34fac681ce0ec2aa22a46761640b06f9"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_85422e7caab040e4b58bfd0de5ac14ec","id":"pg_d9cfafacdd5f58599912f594682f0d34","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/haseeb-heaven-open-agent-gemini-md-575401684ec1-f594682f0d34.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_6ec5cd1eda9958b8af2080f42be6b623"],"title":"haseeb-heaven/open-agent/GEMINI.md @ 575401684ec1","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_85422e7caab040e4b58bfd0de5ac14ec"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_034d9f2726efc55bc1b8b61472a3cb2c4b7435cc0dfe0a13f07f8007aa7ee584"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A 'Sandbox Expansion Request' mechanism lets the agent ask for extra permissions (directories, network) when a sandboxed command is denied or proactively flagged, executed only after user approval for that run."},{"claim_ids":["clm_12f396a2de65bc00993fb3d150ecdedf95e292e3d7a7cb8b6e2271714a11f29e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The docs note sandboxing reduces but does not eliminate risk, and GUI applications may not work inside sandboxes."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6327d588d85fdc9505c10bace3cd7ec0cf7d455216763f2c08866c280019c36c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"macOS Seatbelt sandboxing offers profiles (permissive-open default, permissive-proxied, restrictive-*, strict-*) selected via the SEATBELT_PROFILE env var, controlling write and network restrictions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a56667b19e5ead01debe255e8bcd864f3c171dc0425718866fee2fc03234d132"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"LXC/LXD sandboxing is Linux-only and experimental: the container must already exist and be running before starting open-agent, which does not create it automatically, and the workspace must be writable at the same absolute path inside the container."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e193c63cea3e784214f330ee56e1ac19e4f123666a3daa67cb426fad634255e1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Sandboxing can be enabled via the -s/--sandbox flag, the OPENAGENT_SANDBOX env var (docker, podman, sandbox-exec, runsc, lxc, with legacy GEMINI_SANDBOX alias), or settings.json, in that precedence order."}],"claim_ids":["clm_034d9f2726efc55bc1b8b61472a3cb2c4b7435cc0dfe0a13f07f8007aa7ee584","clm_12f396a2de65bc00993fb3d150ecdedf95e292e3d7a7cb8b6e2271714a11f29e","clm_6327d588d85fdc9505c10bace3cd7ec0cf7d455216763f2c08866c280019c36c","clm_a56667b19e5ead01debe255e8bcd864f3c171dc0425718866fee2fc03234d132","clm_e193c63cea3e784214f330ee56e1ac19e4f123666a3daa67cb426fad634255e1"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_85422e7caab040e4b58bfd0de5ac14ec","id":"pg_fdc8eb4cef245cb8a7246810545c2ef6","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/haseeb-heaven-open-agent-docs-cli-sandbox-md-575401684ec1-6810545c2ef6.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_5360577a2fd551438291830585c626a4"],"title":"haseeb-heaven/open-agent/docs/cli/sandbox.md @ 575401684ec1","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_85422e7caab040e4b58bfd0de5ac14ec"}
